<title>USA: Allied Research unit wins $84 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Allied Research unit wins $84 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Research Corp said on Thursday that its MECAR SA unit won an $84 million contract from an undisclosed client to supply various ammunition types.</p>
<p>The contract raises Allied's backlog to about $137 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Allied is a defense and electronic security firm. Its shares were trading at 10 on Thursday, up a point from its Wednesday close to a level that if it holds would exceed the company's 52-week high of 9-3/8.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
